    "sentence_translations": [
      "About “Eggs”",
      "",
      "“Egg” is a very interesting word in the Chinese language.",
      "People commonly use it to say many other words, often ones without a very good meaning.",
      "",
      "If people think that someone is very bad, they can say that they are a “bad egg” or a “really bad egg”.",
      "",
      "If people think that someone is extremely stupid, they can say that they are an “idiot”.",
      "",
      "If people think that someone is a bit bad and doesn’t think things through, they can say that they are a “scoundrel”.",
      "“Hun” means “mixed up”. This is the worst kind of egg!",
      "Someone might use this word if he gets angry, “You’re a scoundrel!”",
      "",
      "What’s more interesting, if someone gets into trouble, they can say, “Oh my God, I’m done for!”"
    ]
